      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "The big one of the day and it could very well be another Cup for Gavin Bedggood. He won last week's Caulfield Cup, the previous weekend's Seymour Cup and has found the perfect race for REGAL LION (1). The first two runs this time in have been in better races than this, over distances short of his best, and he was beaten only 2 lengths last time. This looks the perfect progression. AFTERMATH (3) is on the back-up after contesting his hometown Cup, when he found only one better, and will make his own luck on-speed with Linda Meech to ride. SHAIYHAR (2) is better than the three runs to date this in would indicate and the combination of dropping in class and extra fitness should see an improved run. SAVEADATEFORME (4) might be a player from the low draw after rediscovering his best last start.",
